From 8176a21e579be850d62de835ce5d658225fc41da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tcg): add a persistent, content keyed translation pack

Translated blocks are stored in a pack file keyed by the guest code
content, so a second boot of the same guest loads translations instead
of generating them.

- accel/tcg/pcache.c: the pack store; pcache-tcg.c: load and store of
  TBs through it, a constant pool sorted by image offset, lookup
  without a lock, no proving for a read-only pack or a full pack.
- Verification of loaded translations against a fresh one in tests.
- tests/unit/test-pcache.c and the system tests pcache-run, pcache-ptr
  and pcache-bytes, including mutants for mode and pool order.
